  <question type="multichoice">
    <name><text>NEET_UG_BIOLOGY_CHAPTER5_DIAGRAM_Q04 - Molecular basis of sickle-cell anaemia mutation</text></name>
    <questiontext format="html"><text><![CDATA[
      <p>The diagram below compares the normal haemoglobin (\(Hb^A\)) allele with the sickle-cell haemoglobin (\(Hb^S\)) allele. Identify the amino acid <strong>X</strong> substituted at the sixth position of the \(\beta\)-globin chain and the type of mutation responsible for this condition.</p>
      <p>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 480 250" width="480" height="250" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #ffffff;">
          <rect x="10" y="10" width="460" height="230" rx="8" fill="#fafafa" stroke="#cccccc" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          <defs>
            <marker id="arr2" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto-start-reverse">
              <path d="M 0 1 L 10 5 L 0 9 z" fill="#f57f17"/>
            </marker>
          </defs>

          <!-- Left panel: Normal HbA -->
          <text x="125" y="36" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="bold" fill="#1b5e20">Normal Hb(A) Gene</text>
          <text x="125" y="58" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-family="monospace" fill="#222222">...GAG...</text>
          <text x="125" y="75" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-family="monospace" fill="#222222">...CTC...</text>
          <line x1="125" y1="82" x2="125" y2="112" stroke="#f57f17" stroke-width="2.5" marker-end="url(#arr2)"/>
          <text x="125" y="130" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="bold" fill="#333333">mRNA: ...GAG...</text>
          <line x1="125" y1="138" x2="125" y2="168" stroke="#f57f17" stroke-width="2.5" marker-end="url(#arr2)"/>
          
